      "description": "Outbound calls to the payment middleware, SMS gateways (Msegat, Unifonic, GIG, AlRajhi Takaful), IVR and other HTTP dependencies, plus the inbound payment webhook. Transport level only: a gateway that answers 200 with an error in the body counts as a success. ELM (SOAP), Urway's curl call and Cloud Storage are not traced yet. Generated by docs/observability/signoz/tools/build_dashboards.py; edit the generator, not the JSON."
    },
